---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '@/lib/site';
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description={`About ${SITE.title}, ${SITE.byline.toLowerCase()}.`}>
  <section class="wrap" style="padding-top:56px;padding-bottom:32px">
    <div class="mono muted" style="margin-bottom:14px"><a href="/">Home</a> / About</div>
    <h1 class="disp" style="font-size:clamp(72px,12vw,180px)">About</h1>
  </section>
  <div class="wrap" style="padding-bottom:80px">
    <div class="prose" style="margin-left:0">
      <p>{SITE.title} is the writing and thinking layer of {SITE.author}'s work: software engineering, AI and technology, productivity, systems, entrepreneurship, careers, project lessons, experiments and long-form technical writing.</p>
      <p>{SITE.author} is a creator, engineer, educator, builder and entrepreneur. {SITE.title} is one part of a larger system called <a href="/building-dev-universe/dev-universe/">Dev Universe</a>, where learning, creating, teaching, sharing and building are meant to work together instead of apart.</p>
      <p>You can also find {SITE.author} on <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@saranmahadev">YouTube</a> and <a href="https://www.instagram.com/everything.by.dev">Instagram</a>.</p>
      <p>To write to {SITE.author}, open any post and use the private message box. Only the two of you can see it. See <a href="/security/">Security and privacy</a> for how that works.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
